<title>ITALY: Gross yield set at 7.99pct at Italy 30-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield set at 7.99pct at Italy 30-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		     Nov 1, 2026	    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 7.00 pct		 7.26</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.99 pct		 8.28</p>
<p> Assigned price 93.20		    90.25</p>
<p> Bids	     3.089 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction on April 29.</p>
</text>
